      "description": "Career page - Stockholm School of Economics Available Positions Departments Available Positions Department All job areas CSR Center for Retailing Department of Accounting Department of Economics Department of Entrepreneurship, Innovation and Technology Department of Finance Department of Law, Languages and Economic Statistics Department of Management and Organization Department of Marketing and Strategy Education Office Executive Education External Relations F1RST Facilities Group Finance HOSS Human Resources IT Services Library Midterm Evaluation President´s Office Professor Promotion Committee SHOF SIR SITE SSE Business Lab SSE Business Lab Strategic and Academic Governance Tenure promotion Assistant Professor (Tenure Track) Position in Information Systems and Innovation Management with a focus on Artificial Intelligence – House of Innovation, Stockholm School of Economics Department of Entrepreneurship, Innovation and Technology, Stockholm Last application date 01.Oct.2026 Project Manager – Academic Ceremonies to the Stockholm School of Economics External Relations, Stockholm Last application date 13.Sep.2026 Tenure track faculty position in HRM, Leadership, Organization Studies or Organizational Behaviour Department of Management and Organization, Stockholm Last application date 01.Oct.2026 Executive Director to Center for Art & Innovation at Stockholm School of Economics Department of Entrepreneurship, Innovation and Technology, Stockholm Last application date 13.Sep.2026 Research Assistants and Teaching Assistants – House of Innovation, Stockholm School of Economics Department of Entrepreneurship, Innovation and Technology, Stockholm A career page by Grade Varbi × We use cookies for login, improved user experience, share links and in some cases marketing and collection of statistics. Accept all cookies Accept only necessary Read more about our cookies here"
